TTF+27 SplitTryte Keyboard Extension Bank v1.0

Extended set for unrepresented standard keyboard and Android/mobile symbols.

[LAYOUT]
splitTryte = [11|OPTIONS|BANK_L|VAL_L2|VAL_L1|VAL_L0|BANK_R|VAL_R2|VAL_R1|VAL_R0]
standard_marker = 11

[DESIGN_RULES]

1. Every splitTryte stores two self-contained symbols.
2. No shift/caps state is required for uppercase/lowercase.
3. BANK:+ is ASCII and Core Keyboard Extras.
4. BANK:- is Extended Currency and Financial/Math Operators.
5. BANK:0 is Extended Mobile Keyboard Shapes and Typographic Extras.
6. Full pair table is generated by crossing every left symbol against every right symbol.

[BANK_LANES]

+ = UPPER_ALPHA          = 10
- = LOWER_ALPHA          = 00
0 = NETIV_NUMERIC_SYMBOL = 01

[VAL_LANES]
00 = --- = 00|00|00
01 = --0 = 00|00|01
02 = --+ = 00|00|10
